  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Roy Speer was an American entrepreneur who co-founded Home Shopping Network with Bud Paxson, building a fortune by selling merchandise directly to television viewers. A lawyer and property developer before entering broadcasting, he later sold control of the shopping business and pursued a wide range of property and technology investments.",
